---
/**
 * Registered on TinaMarkdown's `p` override for a blog post body
 * (BlogPostView.astro). An image-only paragraph (Tina wraps a
 * markdown-standalone image in a <p>, confirmed by querying real content —
 * see tina/collections/blog.ts's comment on why body is rich-text, not
 * fixed fields) also passes through here, but text sizing/line-height has
 * no visible effect on a <div>, so it's harmless.
 */
---

<p class="mb-[22px] text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-ink/78 last:mb-0">
  <slot />
</p>
